  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRAIDCRAFT EXCHANGE - TRADE PROGRAMME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Goal: The grant would enable Traidcraft to:
&#x2022;	Continue to closely monitor the EPA negotiations and to work with our ACP partners to support their resistance to these deals, through a range of advocacy activities in Europe and support to partners in East Africa;
&#x2022;	Build on the EPA work and broaden this to tackle the EU&#x2019;s increasingly ambitious bilateral trade negotiation agenda through work on the planned EU-Indian Free Trade Agreement (FTA) bilateral and others as they arise;
&#x2022;	Develop and implement a programme of research and advocacy to ensure improved incomes and reduced vulnerability for small producers of key commodity products (tea, cotton and sugar) in East Africa, South Asia and South East Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
